# Advanced Strategy Pattern Implementation for Optimizing Algorithm Performance

## Introduction

In high-traffic e-commerce platforms, pricing algorithms play a critical role in determining the user experience and operational efficiency. The Strategy Pattern offers a robust solution for decoupling these algorithms from the core application logic, allowing for independent selection and optimization. In this guide, weâ€™ll implement the Strategy Pattern in Java, Python, and Go while addressing performance metrics, testing strategies, and migration considerations.

## 1. Complete Implementations

### 1.1 Java Implementation (Spring Boot)

```java
// PricingStrategy.java
public interface PricingStrategy {
    double calculatePrice(Order order);
}

