For the Identity Map to be effective, it needs to integrate with the existing DAO layer. Below are modifications to demonstrate how this can be done.

### Java DAO Example

```java
public class ProductDAO {
    private final IdentityMap<Product> identityMap = new IdentityMap<>();

    public Product getProductById(String productId) {
        Product product = identityMap.get(productId);
        if (product != null) {
            return product; // Return from cache
        }
        // Simulate database call
        product = fetchFromDatabase(productId);
        identityMap.put(productId, product); // Cache the result
        return product;
    }

    private Product fetchFromDatabase(String productId) {
        // Simulate a database fetch
        return new Product(productId, "Product Name");
    }
}
```

