## 4. Memory Management

To manage memory consumption, we can implement an eviction policy, such as Least Recently Used (LRU) cache or time-based expiration.

### Java LRU Cache Implementation

```java
import java.util.LinkedHashMap;
import java.util.Map;

public class LRUIdentityMap<T> extends LinkedHashMap<String, T> {
    private final int capacity;

    public LRUIdentityMap(int capacity) {
        super(capacity, 0.75f, true);
        this.capacity = capacity;
    }

    @Override
    protected boolean removeEldestEntry(Map.Entry<String, T> eldest) {
        return size() > capacity;
    }
}
```

