### 1.2. Optimistic Locking Service

Next, we will implement a service that manages the resources with optimistic locking.

#### Java Implementation

```java
// Java: ResourceService.java
import java.util.concurrent.ConcurrentHashMap;

public class ResourceService {
    private ConcurrentHashMap<String, Resource> resources = new ConcurrentHashMap<>();

    public Resource getResource(String id) {
        return resources.get(id);
    }

    public boolean updateResource(String id, Resource newResource) {
        Resource currentResource = resources.get(id);
        if (currentResource != null && currentResource.getVersion() == newResource.getVersion()) {
            resources.put(id, newResource);
            return true; // Update successful
        }
        return false; // Concurrency conflict
    }
}
```

