|-------------------------|--------------------------------------------|---------------------------------------------|----------------------------------------|
| **Scalability**         | Easy to scale horizontally with services   | Complexity increases with many modules      | Microservices architecture             |
| **Performance**         | Fast access with in-memory caching         | Can lead to stale data if not managed      | CQRS with event sourcing               |
| **Maintainability**     | Clear separation of concerns                | Can become difficult if module dependencies grow | Monolithic architecture                 |
| **Concurrency**         | Thread-safe operations                      | Still requires careful handling of shared state | Event-driven architecture               |

