## Caching Mechanism
To optimize performance, especially for large product catalogs, we can implement a caching mechanism for frequently accessed specifications.

### Java Implementation
```java
// SpecificationCache.java
import java.util.HashMap;
import java.util.Map;

public class SpecificationCache {
    private Map<String, Boolean> cache = new HashMap<>();

    public boolean get(Specification<Product> spec, Product product) {
        String key = spec.getClass().getName() + product.hashCode();
        if (cache.containsKey(key)) {
            return cache.get(key);
        }
        boolean result = spec.isSatisfiedBy(product);
        cache.put(key, result);
        return result;
    }
}
```

