#### Premium User Specification

```java
// PremiumUserSpecification.java (Java)
public class PremiumUserSpecification implements Specification<Product> {
    private final boolean isPremiumUser;

    public PremiumUserSpecification(boolean isPremiumUser) {
        this.isPremiumUser = isPremiumUser;
    }

    @Override
    public boolean isSatisfiedBy(Product product) {
        if (isPremiumUser) {
            return product.hasPremiumPromotion();
        }
        return true; // No restrictions for non-premium users
    }
}

// premium_user_specification.py (Python)
