## 8. Migration Guide
### Refactoring to/from MVVM
- **To MVVM**: Identify components that can be separated into Models, Views, and ViewModels. Refactor code to adhere to the MVVM structure.
- **From MVVM**: Remove the ViewModel layer and integrate logic back into the component, which may affect separation of concerns and testability.

## 9. Trade-Off Analysis
