1. **Client-Side Rendering**: Using React enables efficient re-renders, minimizing the load on the server.
2. **Server-Side Processing**: Use caching mechanisms in the Model to reduce database hits.
3. **Lazy Loading**: Implement code splitting in the View to reduce initial load time.

