## 8. Migration Guide

### 8.1 Refactoring to Composite View
When transitioning to the Composite View pattern:
- Identify existing UI components.
- Group related components into composite structures.
- Ensure that each component adheres to the IComponent interface.

### 8.2 Transitioning from Composite View
If you find that the Composite View pattern has become too complex:
- Identify components that can be simplified.
- Consider breaking down deep hierarchies into simpler compositions.
